{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#card-zh","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 是 DSH Web 的出站代理插件，可在运行中切换直连、系统代理和手动代理。它通过 Undici dispatcher 路由进程内 fetch 请求，支持 HTTP(S)、SOCKS5、noProxy 规则及默认回环绕过。通用设置面板可编辑代理地址和绕过列表，侧栏菜单可快速切换并查看最近应用状态。配置更新后立即生效；手动模式需填写代理 URL，系统模式读取环境代理并可回退到 macOS 系统代理。适合需要调整 DSH 网络出口或让后续子进程沿用代理配置的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-53","lib/index.js:669-688","lib/client.js:294-310"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#card-en","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-proxy switches DSH Web outbound traffic between direct, system, and manual proxy modes. It routes fetch through an Undici dispatcher with HTTP(S), SOCKS5, noProxy rules, and loopback bypass. Settings and a sidebar menu control modes and show route status. Manual mode needs a proxy URL.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:29-53","lib/index.js:669-688","lib/client.js:294-310"]}
