{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#feature-routing","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 的功能「运行时代理路由」：在 direct、system、manual 模式间应用出站路由，并替换或恢复全局 Undici dispatcher。配置更新时重新应用，无需为每次切换重启 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:560-588","lib/index.js:669-675"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#feature-bypass","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 的功能「绕过代理规则」：按主机名、子域名、端口或通配规则匹配 noProxy；默认将 localhost、127.0.0.0/8、::1 和 0.0.0.0 直连。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:98-133","lib/index.js:181-202"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#feature-ui","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 的功能「网页代理控制」：在通用设置区编辑代理配置，并从侧栏菜单切换直连、跟随系统或手动模式；界面可读取最近应用的路由状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:294-310","lib/index.js:680-686"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#feature-child","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 的功能「子进程代理环境」：启用 exportEnv 后，将代理和绕过列表环境变量应用到 DSH 进程环境，让切换后启动的子进程继承代理设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-47","lib/index.js:560-588"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-proxy#caveat-manual-config","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-proxy","commit":"53b099c34725caf79f5c59dc2900078222f22ddb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-proxy 使用手动代理模式时，需要在 profile 的 dsh-proxy 配置段填写有效的 HTTP(S) 或 SOCKS5 代理 URL；直连模式不需要代理地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:32-53","lib/index.js:305-315"]}
